From 916ecc2e4d587af7bae6a1d47c3dfd55a0956348 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stefan <46031448+StefanPetersTM@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 22:38:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] cleanup: remove embedded Pavonis diagnostics after CP3114

Keep the functional private-lab timing and transport accommodations proven by CP3114 while deleting default-off traces and captures from production paths. This leaves diagnostics to dedicated instrumentation and offline tooling.
